---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Support & Seva Sanctuary • Muhūrta"
  description="Official support, help guides, troubleshooting, and In-App Purchase assistance for Muhūrta: Vedic Calendar."
>
  <div class="container support-page">
    <div class="support-header">
      <span class="badge-gold">SEVA & ASSISTANCE</span>
      <h1>Support Sanctuary</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        We are devoted to maintaining Muhūrta as an impeccable, authentic Vedic chronometry experience. 
        Explore our guides below or reach out directly for assistance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Help Grid -->
    <div class="support-grid">
      <!-- Contact Card -->
      <div class="glass-panel help-card">
        <div class="card-icon">📬</div>
        <h3>Direct Contact & Inquiries</h3>
        <p>Need assistance with your installation, calculations, or astronomical verification?</p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="mailto:support@shindeaditya.com" class="btn-primary">
            Email Support Team
          </a>
          <span class="contact-sub">Response typically within 24–48 hours</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- GitHub Community -->
      <div class="glass-panel help-card">
        <div class="card-icon">🛠️</div>
        <h3>Open Source & Bug Tracking</h3>
        <p>Muhūrta is completely open-source (GPLv3). Report computational defects, request features, or review astronomical math.</p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/heyshinde/Muhurta/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary">
            Open a GitHub Issue
          </a>
          <span class="contact-sub">Public, community-audited development</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <!-- FAQ 1 -->
        <div class="glass-panel faq-item">
          <h3>Why does the Vedic day differ from my mechanical clock?</h3>
          <p>
            Standard Gregorian calendars tick to a new day at arbitrary midnight (12:00 AM). 
            In classical Vedic chronometry (Sūryasiddhānta), a day (Ahorātra) commences exactly at <strong>Sūryodaya (Astronomical Sunrise)</strong> 
            and continues until the following dawn. The active Tithi, Nakṣatra, and ruling planet reflect this solar reality.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 2 -->
        <div class="glass-panel faq-item">
          <h3>How do voluntary Dakṣiṇā offerings and patronage work?</h3>
          <p>
            Muhūrta is 100% free with zero paywalls. In accordance with Apple App Store Review Guideline 3.1.1, 
            users may optionally offer voluntary Dakṣiṇā to support indie development, server ephemeris data, and open research:
          </p>
          <ul class="faq-bullets">
            <li><strong>🪔 Dīpa Offering ($4.99)</strong>: One-time consumable gift honoring solar calculations.</li>
            <li><strong>🌸 Puṣpa Offering ($9.99)</strong>: One-time consumable gift supporting audio chants.</li>
            <li><strong>🥥 Archana Patron ($24.99)</strong>: One-time consumable gift powering mathematical ephemeris accuracy.</li>
            <li><strong>🏛️ Temple Benefactor ($99.99)</strong>: One-time consumable gift sustaining long-term preservation.</li>
            <li><strong>✨ Annual Seeker Patron ($9.99 / year)</strong>: Optional auto-renewing yearly patronage.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 3 -->
        <div class="glass-panel faq-item">
          <h3>How do I restore my previous purchases or subscriptions?</h3>
          <p>
            If you change devices or reinstall Muhūrta, open the app, navigate to <strong>Profile</strong> -> tap 
            <strong>Contribute & Seva</strong> (or the Dakṣiṇā button) -> scroll to the bottom and tap <strong>Restore Purchases</strong>. 
            StoreKit will automatically synchronize with your Apple ID.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 4 -->
        <div class="glass-panel faq-item">
          <h3>Why does Muhūrta require location access?</h3>
          <p>
            Astronomical sunrise, solar noon (Madhyāhna), twilight (Sandhyā), and Tithi transitions are purely geographic. 
            A person in New York experiences sunrise hours away from someone in Ujjain or London. 
            Your location is processed <strong>strictly on-device</strong> using local mathematics and is never uploaded, tracked, or shared.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 5 -->
        <div class="glass-panel faq-item">
          <h3>How can I cancel an Annual Seeker Patronage subscription?</h3>
          <p>
            Subscriptions are managed securely by Apple. To cancel or modify your patronage:
            Open your device's <strong>Settings</strong> -> Tap your <strong>Apple ID Name</strong> -> 
            Tap <strong>Subscriptions</strong> -> Select <strong>Muhūrta</strong> -> Tap <strong>Cancel Subscription</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .support-page {
    padding: 60px 0 100px;
  }

  .support-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 56px;
  }

  .support-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    margin: 14px 0 16px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .support-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .help-card {
    padding: 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .help-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .help-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .contact-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq-section h2 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .faq-item {
    padding: 28px 32px;
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--gold-light);
  }

  .faq-item p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .faq-bullets {
    margin-top: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .support-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .support-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
